+    /*
+      NOTE: Directly transitioning between two *different* intrinsic keyword
+      sizes (e.g. block-size: min-content -> max-content, or auto -> fit-content)
+      is NOT supported, even with interpolate-size: allow-keywords. Only
+      transitions between a fixed <length-percentage> (like 0) and a single
+      intrinsic keyword (or calc-size() of that keyword) can be interpolated.
+      That's why we animate from 0 to calc-size(auto, size + 2rem).
